 "text": "Horizon Resources | Williston, ND - Home\nMain\nUtilities\nWho We Are\nDivisions\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nFeed\nGrain\nRetail\nWholesale Energy\nCommunity\nOnline Bill Pay\nCareers\nContact\nVIEW CASH BIDS AND FUTURES\nPODCAST\n701.572.2171\nHORIZON RESOURCES\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 character allowed.\nVIEW CASH BIDS AND FUTURES\nPODCAST\n701.572.2171\nHORIZON RESOURCES\nSolutions for Your Success\nWe’re proud to serve our members. Experience the Horizon Advantage, where “The Solution” isn’t just a concept; it’s our exceptional team with decades of expertise and a passion for serving you. Whether you’re a seasoned farmer, a livestock owner, or homeowner, we have the perfect solution for your needs.\nCONTACT US\nAgronomy\nLearn More\nEnergy\nLearn More\nGrain\nLearn More\nFeed\nLearn More\nRetail\nLearn More\nWeather\nLayers\nAll Layers\nWeather\nSevere Weather\nRadar\nSatellite\nNWS Bulletins\nSevere Weather Risk - Today\nObservations\nSurface Winds\nFronts\nSoil Temperatures\nCrop Moisture Index\nRainfall Estimate\nGrowing Degree Units\nGrowing Degree Units Contour\nPalmer Drought Index\nDrought Monitor\nForecast\nJet Stream Winds\nTropical Forecast\n24-Hour Forecast Precip\n24-Hour Forecast Fronts\n48-Hour Forecast Precip\n48-Hour Forecast Fronts\nPresets\nSurface Weather Analysis\n24-Hour Surface Forecast\n48-Hour Surface Forecast\nTropical Analysis\nLegend\nRadar\n2:30 AM\n© Mapbox © OpenStreetMap Improve this map\nAgricultural Solutions for Your Success\nSERVING FARMERS IN NORTH DAKOTA AND MONTANA\nIf your farm or ranch is a part of the Horizon Resources member network, you’ll be able to take advantage of many different services that can benefit you. We’re an agricultural cooperative based in Williston, ND, and serving roughly 3 million acres of Western North Dakota and Eastern Montana. Our members know that we’ll go the extra mile to serve them to the best of our abilities.\nIf you’re interested in becoming a member of our cooperative, reach out to us today. Click below for membership application in printable PDF format.\nPersonal Credit Application\nBusiness Credit Application\nNew\nLoyalty/Patronage Card\nHorizon Resources now requires a Loyalty/Patronage Card to purchase at our convenience stores. Cards are needed for all individuals charging to an account. Clerks can no longer look up account numbers at checkout.\nNeed a card?\nFill out the form to request one for yourself or your team.\nQuestions? Call 701-572-2171 OPT 3\nAccount Number\nExp Date\nIn-Store Patronage Cards\nName on Account\nWho to contact when cards arrive\nFull Name\nPhone Number\nPlease list identifying names or vehicle numbers\n*If additional lines are needed, please write the identifying names and PIN’s on a separate sheet and send all pages together.*\nSignature\nDate\nHorizon Resources Williston Grain Expansion Project\nFuel, Grain, Feed and More\nWe provide a wide range of resources to our member owners.\nCONTACT US\nLearn more about the services we offer to MEMBERS AND NON-MEMBERS\nWe run several different divisions to provide a variety of services to our members and their communities. Our divisions include:\nEnergy: We provide our members with the propane, gasoline and diesel fuel they need.\nFeed: Count on us to provide the feed you need for your cattle, poultry or livestock.\nGrain: Our staff provides excellent market intel, fair grading, and quick payment.\nRetail: We run five different Cenex branded gas stations.\nAgronomy: Members benefit from services such as crop scouting, farm planning, fertilizer delivery and more.\nContact us today so we can be part of your success!\nYou work HARD and we do too.\nOur agricultural cooperative has been serving agricultural producers in the area for nearly 100 years. We pride ourselves on the quality of our services and products. Our goal is to make the everyday lives of our members more productive.\nDo you have any questions or want to speak with one of our team members about the services you need? Call 701.572.2171 now.\n317 2ND ST W, Williston, ND 58801\n701.572.2171\nWho We Are\nDivisions\nCommunity\nONLINE BILL PAY\nCareers\nContact\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nGrain\nPodcast\nFeed\nRetail\nClick To Call\nContact Us\nGet Directions\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 Horizon Resources - All rights reserved",
